          <msContents>
            <summary>De memoria tractatulus. Joannes de toletto. Ars memorandi. 

Written in a neat rounded gothic hand, 25 lines to a page. Capitals, paragraph marks and underlinings in red. 

Fol. 1 tractatus Clarissimi physici et/Medici Matheoli perusini de Memo/ria/. IAmdiu Brocarde et Bona/uentura viri dignissimi...7v ...pro/conseruanda memoria et ita finem facio. JOANNES de Toleto. Ars memorandi Fol. 8 Circa initium Artis/memorandi notandum/Quod licet medici tam noui quam veteres/ad memoriam recuperandam... 10, line 12 EGo Ioannes de Toleto/in sacra pagina Doctor et vtri/usque iuris professor. Canonicus ecclesie/Contiburgensis eiusdem 12 ...Cui est honor et gloria in secula/seculorum Amen.</summary>
